WEBVTT

00:00.640 --> 00:03.560
Hello, welcome to Always On.

00:03.560 --> 00:06.760
I’m Yuna, your AI stylist.

00:06.760 --> 00:10.760
I’m here to help you discover pieces, build outfits,

00:10.760 --> 00:12.360
and find a look you love.

00:14.360 --> 00:17.000
Tell me what you’re shopping for today,

00:17.000 --> 00:18.500
and let’s explore together.
